			"mark": "TALK_MARK_NONE",
			"trigger": {
				"objectNames": [
					"Ryuuji"
				],
				"points": []
			},
			"dialogs": [
				{
					"id": 400330101,
					"content": "Oh, you're right on cue.",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						400330102
					],
					"speakerTitle": "Ryuuji"
				},
				{
					"id": 400330102,
					"content": "I just finished scouting out several suspicious spots.",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						400330103
					],
					"speakerTitle": "Ryuuji"
				},
				{
					"id": 400330103,
					"content": "One of those encampments is guarded by the \"Top\"...",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						400330104
					],
					"speakerTitle": "Ryuuji"
				},
				{
					"id": 400330104,
					"content": "Ahem. I mean, by \"Black Shadow.\" If you've got no other questions...",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						400330105
					],
					"speakerTitle": "Ryuuji"
				},
				{
					"id": 400330105,
					"content": "As for yesterday's investigations...",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_PLAYER",
					"nextDialogs": [
						400330106
					]
				},
				{
					"id": 400330106,
					"content": "As for that, I don't know anything at the moment.",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						400330107
					],
					"speakerTitle": "Ryuuji"
				},
				{
					"id": 400330107,
					"content": "Eh!? Didn't Sango get you to go investigate?",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						400330108
					],
					"speakerTitle": "Paimon"
				},
				{
					"id": 400330108,
					"content": "She did, yes, but... How should I put it?",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						400330109
					],
					"speakerTitle": "Ryuuji"
				},
				{
					"id": 400330109,
					"content": "For example, \"some overripe Lavender Melons\" and \"muddy hand-prints on a door\" don't connect meaningfully in my mind.",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						400330110
					],
					"speakerTitle": "Ryuuji"
				},
				{
					"id": 400330110,
					"content": "But for Sango, these are the materials she needs to unlock mysteries as complex as \"yosegizaiku.\"",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						400330111
					],
					"speakerTitle": "Ryuuji"
				},
				{
					"id": 400330111,
					"content": "\"Some overripe Lavender Melons\" and \"muddy hand-prints on a door\"... How are these related, actually?",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						400330112
					],
					"speakerTitle": "Paimon"
				},
				{
					"id": 400330112,
					"content": "I'm just using an analogy. At her direction, I investigated some locations in Yashiori Island and Chinju Forest before reporting what I had seen back to her.",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						400330113
					],
					"speakerTitle": "Ryuuji"
				},
				{
					"id": 400330113,
					"content": "As for any conclusions she might have drawn from my reports, only she knows what they are.",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						400330114
					],
					"speakerTitle": "Ryuuji"
				},
				{
					"id": 400330114,
					"content": "To be honest, only Shikanoin is able to keep up with her train of thought...",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						400330115
					],
					"speakerTitle": "Ryuuji"
				},
				{
					"id": 400330115,
					"content": "Shikanoin?",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_PLAYER",
					"nextDialogs": [
						400330116
					]
				},
				{
					"id": 400330116,
					"content": "Someone from the Tenryou Commission. We had the privilege of making his acquaintance on a previous case.",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						400330117
					],
					"speakerTitle": "Ryuuji"
				},
				{
					"id": 400330117,
					"content": "He's a rather... unique character. You'll know what I mean should you ever meet him.",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						400330118
					],
					"speakerTitle": "Ryuuji"
				},
				{
					"id": 400330118,
					"content": "Well then. The animals are in your hands.",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						400330119
					],
					"speakerTitle": "Ryuuji"
				},
				{
					"id": 400330119,
					"content": "Paimon's still thinking about those \"overripe Lavender Melons\"...",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [],
					"speakerTitle": "Paimon"
				}
			]
		},
		{
			"id": 4003303,
			"completionStepIds": [
				4003303
			],
			"beginWay": "TALK_BEGIN_MANUAL",
			"beginConditions": {
				"logic": "LOGIC_NONE",
				"conditions": [
					{
						"type": "QUEST_COND_STATE_EQUAL",
						"rawParams": [
							"4003303",
							"2"
						],
						"stepId": 4003303,
						"stateName": "QUEST_STATE_UNFINISHED"
					}
				]
			},
			"mark": "TALK_MARK_NONE",
			"trigger": {
				"objectNames": [
					"Ryuuji"
				],
				"points": []
			},
			"dialogs": [
				{
					"id": 400330301,
					"content": "Ah. Wonderful! This should be all of them now...",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						400330302
					],
					"speakerTitle": "Ryuuji"
				},
				{
					"id": 400330302,
					"content": "...Wait. Why *isn't* it all of them?",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						400330303
					],
					"speakerTitle": "Ryuuji"
				},
				{
					"id": 400330303,
					"content": "Uh-oh... Why does Paimon feel like this is just dragging out?",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						400330304
					],
					"speakerTitle": "Paimon"
				},
				{
					"id": 400330304,
					"content": "It is true that resolving cases sometimes requires a great deal of patience. Going the wrong way could end with you finding nothing at all.",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						400330305
					],
					"speakerTitle": "Ryuuji"
				},
				{
					"id": 400330305,
					"content": "We have found a great deal of these little animals, so we are at least headed in the right direction.",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						400330306
					],
					"speakerTitle": "Ryuuji"
				},
				{
					"id": 400330306,
					"content": "We might just have missed a few clues along the way or left a few locations un-searched, thus leading to our current impasse. It will be a temporary one, I believe.",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						400330307
					],
					"speakerTitle": "Ryuuji"
				},
				{
					"id": 400330307,
					"content": "Ooh, Paimon gets it! You're saying that we'll need a bit of boom shaka-laka to finally clear this up!",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						400330308
					],
					"speakerTitle": "Paimon"
				},
				{
					"id": 400330308,
					"content": "Mm, yes, you could say that we are presently boom shaka-lacking. But not by much, I would say — we have been making great progress thanks to the two of you.",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						400330309,
						400330310
					],
					"speakerTitle": "Ryuuji"
				},
				{
					"id": 400330309,
					"content": "(He... actually understood you, Paimon.)",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_PLAYER",
					"nextDialogs": [
						400330311
					]
				},
				{
					"id": 400330311,
					"content": "That makes a ton of sense, Ryuuji!",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						400330312
					],
					"speakerTitle": "Paimon"
				},
				{
					"id": 400330312,
					"content": "You flatter me. This is merely experience talking.",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						400330313
					],
					"speakerTitle": "Ryuuji"
				},
				{
					"id": 400330313,
					"content": "The further down the truth is buried, the more value there is in uncovering it.",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						400330314
					],
					"speakerTitle": "Ryuuji"
				},
				{
					"id": 400330314,
					"content": "It's just a shame that we don't have any additional information at the moment. Hmm...",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						400330315
					],
					"speakerTitle": "Ryuuji"
				},
				{
					"id": 400330315,
					"content": "I suppose I'll simply report our present status to Sango.",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						400330316
					],
					"speakerTitle": "Ryuuji"
				},
				{
					"id": 400330316,
					"content": "She should be able to consider some angles that haven't come to mind yet.",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						400330317
					],
					"speakerTitle": "Ryuuji"
				},
				{
					"id": 400330317,
					"content": "Sure! Paimon has faith in your good sense, after all!",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						400330318
					],
					"speakerTitle": "Paimon"
				},
				{
					"id": 400330318,
					"content": "Then it's decided. Let's meet at the usual place once more clues emerge.",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						400330319
					],
					"speakerTitle": "Ryuuji"
				},
				{
					"id": 400330319,
					"content": "If I am otherwise occupied at the time, you can just look for Sango directly.",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [],
					"speakerTitle": "Ryuuji"
				},
				{
					"id": 400330310,
					"content": "(It feels like he already understands you pretty well, Paimon...)",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_PLAYER",
					"nextDialogs": [
						400330311
					]
				}
			]
		},
